        "max_brake": 0.6
      }
    }
  },
  "source": "racing_game-owned variant of physics_sim's assist_unit_street.json with the abs and esc blocks of assist_unit_abs_esc.json added (physics ships the ABS/ESC unit as a stand-alone street unit without traction control, so a garage choice that keeps the car's traction-control modes needs the blocks in one file). Every number is copied unchanged from those two files; see their sources."
}
